Ozzie is a big orcish man of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], a guardian who stands in front of the others and takes the fight. He wears half-plate set with a couple of blinking lights. His skin is rough, his head is shaved but for a patch of burn scar, and a slash scar cuts through his beard. He fights with a maul and demands that his enemies kneel. [[People/Scrazzy|Scrazzy]] and [[People/Foral|Foral]] pulled him out of the mud, he says, and he means to see Foral home to his daughter.
